/*
  FleetApiSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0004 · FleetApiSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  FleetApiSection resolves (table "FleetApiSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  Keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/admin/components/devtools/FleetApiSection.tsx + ToolCard / ResultPanel /
  TelemetryErrorsPanel / helpers / constants). The `devtools.*` keys mirror the web
  i18n keys; the bare-label keys (Config, Partner Reg, …) mirror the web `t('Label')`
  calls. The remaining keys back native chrome (freshness chip, banners, a11y).
*/

